        "status": "pass",
        "rationale": "Inspected both dialogue lines and supplied-chest approach at desktop and 390px phone scale. Wren, player, Fernling and chest remain visible; actual text fragments clear Next/Done; the live objective is readable in the sidebar (scrollable on phone). The final fixture keeps the player beside the chest rather than inside its image. Generic engine presentation is not a claim of bespoke adventure polish."
